        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Greatest Hits Volume 1, A Collection of Beatles Oldies\n- People: The Beatles\n- Companies: EMI Australia\n- Places: Australia, New Zealand\n- Topics: greatest hits compilation albums\n\nFacts:\n- Greatest Hits Volume 1 is a greatest hits compilation album by The Beatles.\n- Greatest Hits Volume 1 was released in 1984.\n- Greatest Hits Volume 1 was exclusive to Australia and New Zealand.\n- EMI Australia compiled Greatest Hits Volume 1 to fill a gap.\n- A Collection of Beatles Oldies was similarly intended to fill a gap.\n- A Collection of Beatles Oldies carried the subtitle But Goldies!",
